      "item": "Consolidate the two remaining primary mint client copies onto mintCoopCredential or a shared helper."
    },
    {
      "id": "CF-LSC2-STORE-RULES",
      "severity": "Low",
      "owner": "Root registration follow-up",
      "target": "a separately registered unit owning src/lib/campaign/coop/localSeatCredentialStore.ts (frozen control) and its panel callers",
      "status": "open registration follow-up (review F5)",
      "item": "Three rules live in presentation because the store is frozen: the choice-to-seat-id mapping (LocalSeatCredentialPanel.tsx and the store mint body), the renewal-window and expiry classification in CoopCredentialRenewal, and the join-time never-replace-a-bearer-with-a-different-identity guard in CampaignCoopEntryPanel.tsx (mirrors replaceCoopCredential IDENTITY_CHANGED). The store should export seatIdForChoice, a renewal-state classifier and a join-time bearer-adoption guard, and the panels call them."
    },
    {
      "id": "LSC2-F6-IDENTITY-CHANGED-RECOVERY",
      "severity": "Low",
      "owner": "LSC-2P journey or CF-LSC2-STORE-RULES",
      "target": "LSC-2P packaged journey record; CampaignCoopEntryPanel.tsx and CoopCredentialRenewal (LS16 is frozen)",
      "status": "open gap (review F6); fails closed, not a security issue",
      "item": "At entry, the IDENTITY_CHANGED message says to forget the sign-in and reclaim through co-op entry, but the only per-match forget control is inside CoopCredentialRenewal, which renders nothing while the bearer has more than four minutes left. In the same tab a user who rejoins a match with a different credential has no reachable forget until the window opens (workaround: a new tab). LSC-2P records the journey consequence; a fix needs a registered owner."
    },
    {
      "id": "LSC2-G5-GHOST-REMOVAL-CONTROL",
      "severity": "Info",
      "owner": "LSC-2P",
      "target": "LSC-2P packaged journey step \"ghost retained until ordinary removal\"",
      "status": "routed (admission G5, review G5 ruling)",
      "item": "No ordinary-UI GM ghost-removal control exists and LSC-2 adds none (RemoveParticipant reaches the host only through the transport intent, hosted by LS21c). LSC-2P records the step as absent and does not claim it, unless a UI leaf is registered."
    },
    {
      "id": "CF-LSC2OP-2",
      "severity": "Info",
      "owner": "LSC-2P",
      "target": "LSC-2P packaged proof",
      "status": "in-repo sequence delivered by LSC-2 (LS21); packaged proof open",
      "item": "LSC-2 proves re-provision, new playerId, refusal while the ghost holds a seat, GM RemoveParticipant, then admission in jsdom with real routes and SQLite. LSC-2P proves the same sequence on the installed app and records the ghost-removal step per G5."
    },
    {
